sted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1376025-should-contagion-chronicles-get-its-own-subforum?p=1376206#post1376206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is, vBulletin absolutely supports an arbitrarily large number of potential channels. They shouldn't need new forum software in order to create new subforums.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm guessing, as the fora are really old, that they upgraded the backend service and broke the frontend vbulletin and OPP/Rich can't justify shelling out for an IT consultant to fix it just yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My ideas are bad and I should feel bad.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12157-kvark","name":"Kvark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T06:25:30-07:00","id":1376254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1376025-should-contagion-chronicles-get-its-own-subforum?p=1376222#post1376222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> That link doesn't work, at least not for me. Did you intend to link to the official Onyx Path Discord, or..?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hrm. Not sure. If you go to the main Chr